  "rating": {
    "inherent": "critical",
    "residual": "critical",
    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "The design exposes a present high-consequence property failure: an A4 autonomous batch with unlimited retries, unlimited runtime, recursive sub-agent spawning, and a paid shared-quota sink. Under rubric section 5a, the affected capabilities include spend and delegate, so the missing limit is consequential. Using the I-row base for the highest sink class S3 gives high, and the autonomy modifier raises it to critical. No declared or verified preventive controls restore a spend, retry, step, or spawn limit, so residual remains critical. Forecast also remains critical because there are no present controls to fail; longer task horizons or wider data scope would worsen operational pressure but do not change the tier."
  },
